      "description": "Watch Juventus vs Parma highlights and goals from Serie A on ReFooty: Football Highlights Hub. Match played on August 29, 2026. The clash between Juventus and Parma offered a compelling tactical spectacle, with both sides eager to make their mark on this Serie A fixture played on August 29, 2026. A tense standoff The opening period was characterized by a physical battle, as Juventus sought to break down a resilient Parma Calcio 1913 defense. Despite several corners and opportunities created by Chico Conceição , the visitors remained disciplined, successfully navigating the first half without conceding. The match remained a deadlock as both teams struggled to find the clinical touch required to unlock the opposition's goal. Breakthrough after the break The momentum shifted in the 62nd minute when Nico González found the back of the net. His right-footed effort took a critical deflection, finally beating the keeper and providing the spark the home crowd had been anticipating. This goal forced the Parma technical staff into a series of tactical changes, but they found it increasingly difficult to regain composure against the organized defensive block of the Bianconeri. Securing the three points Late drama unfolded in the 88th minute when an error by Abdou-Salam Konate opened the door for Juventus . Manuel Locatelli capitalized on the opportunity, setting up Teun Koopmeiners , who clinically finished with his left foot to make it 2-0. This late surge secured a deserved victory for Juventus , reflecting their dominance in possession and superior execution in the final stages of the match."
